139	    /**
140	     * Build the customer code for a newly created owner, formatted {@code '<LAST3>-<NNNN>'}
141	     * where LAST3 is the upper-cased first three letters of {@code lastName} and NNNN is a
142	     * global 4-digit zero-padded sequence equal to one more than the current number of owners
143	     * (e.g. {@code 'SMI-0007'}).
